               "caution":  "Extreme share-price volatility—swinging from USD 147.40 in August 2026 down to USD 39.84 on November 20 and back to USD 48.51 on November 23—reflects both high valuation sensitivity and small-cap beta risk. Even after a 67% drawdown, AEHR trades near 10.5x FY2027 sales guidance. Because a single lead hyperscaler drives much of the current Sonoma ramp, any pause in AI capex, qualification delay at Taiwan OSAT sites, or gross-margin mix shift could trigger sharp repricing.",
