                            "Year-to-date bookings exceeded $43.6 million with a 1.46x book-to-bill ratio across 14 active multi-year defense and commercial programs.",
                            "On October 26, OSS\u0027s flagship Gen5 4UP-MAX AI accelerator expansion system earned qualification with a Tier 1 global enterprise computing provider.",
